<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Queensland Cotton year profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Queensland Cotton year profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to February 28</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    22.37  vs  13.28</p>
<p>    Net				     13.26  vs   8.03</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	    18.0   vs  13.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Queensland Cotton Holdings Ltd is one of Australia's largest processors and marketers of cotton.</p>
</text>
